SUMMARY:YOLO Line Dance Social
DESCRIPTION:YOLO Line Dance Social at Great Bear Vineyards in Davis  Thursday\, July 30 | 5:30–9:30 PM\nDust off your boots and join us for an evening of dancing\, great food\, and vineyard fun!\nWhether you’re planning a date night\, a girls’ night out\, coming with friends\, or flying solo\, YOLO Line Dance creates a welcoming community where everyone can join in—no matter your experience level.\nNew to line dancing? We’ve got you covered! Arrive early for a beginner warm-up and lesson before the dance floor opens for everyone.\n Evening Schedule5:30–6:00 PM – Beginner warm-up6:00–6:30 PM – Beginner lesson6:30–8:00 PM – Mixed-level line dance social8:00 PM – Improver/Intermediate lesson8:30 PM–Close – Power Hour Social featuring our most challenging dances\n Dance for a Great Cause\nClass participation is a $5 cash or Venmo donation\, with 100% of proceeds benefiting YOLO County CASA\, supporting children in foster care throughout Yolo County.\n Food & Drinks Available for Purchase Nash & Proper Food Truck serving their famous chicken sandwiches Great Bear wines\, mocktails\, juice\, soda\, and other beverages Cheese\, salami\, olives\, and light snacks\nWhether you’re learning your first steps or dancing all night long\, this is the perfect way to spend a summer evening in the vineyard. Grab your boots\, bring your friends\, and join us for a night of dancing\, sipping\, and supporting a wonderful local cause.\nWe can’t wait to see you on the dance floor!
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/yolo-line-dance-social/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Great-Bear-Vineyards_23GBV-drone-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
