UID:10014574-1785582000-1785603600@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Albarino Wine Stroll
DESCRIPTION:Sip\, Stroll and Enjoy\n\n\n\n\nJourney through the streets of Downtown Winters to celebrate International Albariño Grape Day. Sip on wine and Albariño inspired cocktails at participating tasting rooms & restaurants.\nWith your ticket you’ll enjoy small bites and a half-glass of Albariño wine or Albariño inspired cocktails at participating businesses.\nParticipating Businesses Include: Turkovich Family Wines\, Berryessa Gap Winery\, Ficelle\, Carboni’s Ristorante Bar & Market\, The Buckhorn Steakhouse\, Preserve\, Hooby’s Brewing \nEvent Details: \n\n\nDate: Saturday\, August 1st \n\n\nTime: 11:00 AM – 5:00 PM \n\n\nAge: 21+ (Please have your ID ready at check-in) \n\n\nCheck-in Information: \n\n\nLocation: Corner of Main & Railroad at Rotary Clock (look for the white pop-up tent) \n\n\nWhat to Bring: Your email confirmation and the name your tickets were purchased under. We’ll check your ID\, give you a wristband\, and hand you your event passport. Be sure to hold on to your passport as you’ll need it to access tastings at each stop. \n\n\nPlease note: Check in will close at 3pm. If you arrive after 3pm\, please make your way to Berryessa Gap (15 Main Street) or Turkovich Tasting Room (304 Railroad Ave.) to grab your passport & wristband. \n\n\nPlease note\, we have some additional promotions being offered that day!\n*Valid Saturday\, August 1st. Proof of Albariño Passport Purchase must be presented to redeem these promotions. \nYOLO 365 ARTISAN MARKET – 7 E Main St. #7A\n15% & 20% off Select Vendors \nINDIGO & CO – 9 Main Street\n50% off Sunglasses and any Swimsuits + Swim Cover-ups \nWINTERS COLLECTIVE – 41 Main Street\n40% OFF Women’s Clothing\, 15% OFF Everything Else \nTHE SHOPPE By WINTERS COLLECTIVE – 10 Main Street \n40% OFF Home Décor\, 15% OFF Everything Else \nPUTAH CREEK CAFÈ – 1 Main Street\n20% off a single dinner entrée \nWINTERS MUSEUM – 13 Russell Street\nComplimentary Albariño Wine and Spanish Bite \nSTEADY EDDY’S – 5 East Main Street\nFree Small Iced Coffee with Purchase of Food \nRemember to check out our lodging properties to book your hotel room! \n**This event is for adults 21 and older.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/albarino-wine-stroll-2/
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/yolo-county-wines.jpg
END:VEVENT
